The Claude Code team just shipped a Playground plugin that changes how you interact with Claude. Instead of typing instructions, Claude builds you an interactive tool - sliders, annotation regions, approve/reject buttons - tailored to whatever you are working on. You give feedback visually, and the playground translates it back into precise instructions.

In this video I walk through exactly how it works and build several playgrounds live.

📩 Join our newsletter → https://gritai.kit.com/
🌐 Website → https://www.gritai.studio/
